  3. Settings:
       Exchange  : Binance Futures (USDT-M)
       Symbol    : BTC_USDT  (or any USDT pair)
       Period    : 15 minutes
       Start/End : choose your date range
       Capital   : set to INITIAL_CAPITAL value below (e.g. 10000)
       Leverage  : set to LEVERAGE value below (e.g. 10)
  4. Click Run → results appear in Log panel + Profit chart

STRATEGY:
  Timeframes : M15 (entry signals) + H4 (trend bias)
  ─ Long  : H4 EMA3 > EMA8 AND price > EMA200
             + M15 EMA3 crosses EMA8 upward (fresh crossover)
             + M15 price above VWAP
             + M15 ADX > 20
             + M15 current ATR > average ATR(20)

  ─ Short : H4 EMA3 < EMA8 AND price < EMA200
             + M15 EMA3 crosses EMA8 downward
             + M15 price below VWAP
             + M15 ADX > 20
             + M15 current ATR > average ATR(20)

  Stop Loss  : entry ± 1.5 × ATR(14)
  Take Profit: entry ± 3.0 × ATR(14)   ← R:R = 2:1
  Size       : (balance × 2%) ÷ SL distance in USD

  Risk Guard : if cumulative drawdown ≥ 20% of peak balance
               → close any open trade immediately
               → pause for 12 hours (simulated time)
               → auto-resume and reset peak after cooldown

